  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A rounded frame split by a dashed line into a Control Plane above and a Data Plane below. In the control plane a 'Policy Decision Point' groups a Policy Engine over a Policy Administrator. In the data plane, Subject goes to System, then an 'Untrusted' arrow goes to the Policy Enforcement Point, then a 'Trusted' arrow goes to an Enterprise Resource cylinder; dashed arrows link the PEP and the Policy Administrator. Grey arrows from the left feed in a CDM System, Industry Compliance, Threat Intelligence and Activity Logs; from the right they feed in Data Access Policy, PKI, ID Management and a SIEM System.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "claude-opus-5"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-09-29",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Un cadre arrondi partagé par une ligne pointillée en un Control Plane en haut et un Data Plane en bas. Dans le plan de contrôle, un « Policy Decision Point » regroupe un Policy Engine au-dessus d'un Policy Administrator. Dans le plan de données, Subject va vers System, puis une flèche « Untrusted » va vers le Policy Enforcement Point, puis une flèche « Trusted » vers un cylindre Enterprise Resource ; des flèches pointillées relient le PEP et le Policy Administrator. Des flèches grises venant de la gauche apportent un CDM System, Industry Compliance, Threat Intelligence et Activity Logs ; de la droite, elles apportent Data Access Policy, PKI, ID Management et un SIEM System.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "fr"
    },
    {
      "text": "Un marco redondeado dividido por una línea discontinua en un Control Plane arriba y un Data Plane abajo. En el plano de control, un «Policy Decision Point» agrupa un Policy Engine sobre un Policy Administrator. En el plano de datos, Subject va a System, luego una flecha «Untrusted» va al Policy Enforcement Point y después una flecha «Trusted» va a un cilindro Enterprise Resource; flechas discontinuas unen el PEP y el Policy Administrator. Flechas grises desde la izquierda aportan un CDM System, Industry Compliance, Threat Intelligence y Activity Logs; desde la derecha aportan Data Access Policy, PKI, ID Management y un SIEM System.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "es"
    },
    {
      "text": "إطار مستدير الزوايا يقسمه خط متقطع إلى Control Plane في الأعلى وData Plane في الأسفل. في مستوى التحكم، يضم \"Policy Decision Point\" محرك Policy Engine فوق Policy Administrator. وفي مستوى البيانات، ينتقل Subject إلى System، ثم يمتد سهم \"Untrusted\" إلى Policy Enforcement Point، ثم سهم \"Trusted\" إلى أسطوانة Enterprise Resource؛ وتربط أسهم متقطعة بين PEP وPolicy Administrator. ومن اليسار تغذّي أسهم رمادية كلًّا من CDM System وIndustry Compliance وThreat Intelligence وActivity Logs؛ ومن اليمين Data Access Policy وPKI وID Management وSIEM System.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "ar"
    },
    {
      "text": "Скруглённая рамка, разделённая пунктирной линией на Control Plane сверху и Data Plane снизу. В плоскости управления «Policy Decision Point» объединяет Policy Engine над Policy Administrator. В плоскости данных Subject переходит к System, затем стрелка «Untrusted» ведёт к Policy Enforcement Point, затем стрелка «Trusted» — к цилиндру Enterprise Resource; пунктирные стрелки связывают PEP и Policy Administrator. Серые стрелки слева подают CDM System, Industry Compliance, Threat Intelligence и Activity Logs; справа — Data Access Policy, PKI, ID Management и SIEM System.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "ru"
    },
    {
      "text": "一个圆角框被虚线分为上方的 Control Plane 和下方的 Data Plane。在控制平面中，“Policy Decision Point”包含位于上方的 Policy Engine 和下方的 Policy Administrator。在数据平面中，Subject 指向 System，随后一支标注“Untrusted”的箭头指向 Policy Enforcement Point，再由一支标注“Trusted”的箭头指向 Enterprise Resource 圆柱体；虚线箭头连接 PEP 与 Policy Administrator。左侧的灰色箭头输入 CDM System、Industry Compliance、Threat Intelligence 和 Activity Logs；右侧输入 Data Access Policy、PKI、ID Management 和 SIEM System。",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "zh"
    }
  ],
